commit 95fd78a4b94e0c4c19ee1f9986a9eb0d73c662a5
Author: OpenLiteSpeed Packager <packager@openlitespeed.org>
Date:   Sun May 24 15:39:38 2026 +0000

    build: add USE_SYSTEM_LIBS and FHS_LAYOUT options for distro packaging
    
    Add two new CMake options:
    
    - USE_SYSTEM_LIBS (default OFF): Link against system shared libraries
      (OpenSSL, zlib, PCRE, expat, libxml2, brotli, maxminddb, udns)
      instead of bundled static archives. Removes BoringSSL dependency,
      -nodefaultlibs hack, and static libstdc++ linking.
    
    - FHS_LAYOUT (default OFF): Install to FHS-compliant paths:
      /usr/sbin for binaries, /etc/openlitespeed for config,
      /var/log/openlitespeed for logs, /srv/openlitespeed for docroot.
    
    Both options default to OFF preserving full backward compatibility
    with the existing build.sh workflow.
    
    New files:
    - openlitespeed.spec: RPM spec following OpenMandriva conventions
    - PACKAGING.md: Documentation for distribution packagers

